title: "zenodo-openalex-collection: keep an OpenAlex collection of a Zenodo community up to date"
abstract: >-
  A reusable GitHub workflow and R pipeline (targets) that keeps an OpenAlex
  collection of the deposits in a Zenodo community up to date, using openalexPro.
